39:14.170 --> 39:16.505
They might not like me as much.

39:18.591 --> 39:21.677
I've never... been with one.

39:23.179 --> 39:25.598
You've probably had hundreds.

39:25.723 --> 39:26.724
No.

39:29.018 --> 39:30.770
As a matter of fact,
